-- ============================================================================
-- V52__addon_expenses_einvoices_demo_seed.sql
--
-- Demo seed for Add-on Service > Expenses e-Invoices (rule IR-1:
-- DOC_TYPE='B' for Bill / Expense). Replaces the silent empty-page
-- behaviour the Expenses route exhibited after V51 wiped the legacy
-- '1C25EXP-%' / 'R-%' rows — V51 only re-seeded Sales (DOC_TYPE='I')
-- and the local DB therefore carried zero visible Expenses rows.
--
-- Source
-- ------
-- 30 most-recent visible Expenses rows from JEX DEV (`wecmsvndev`)
-- under tenant VN_VNM0004_000001, captured 2026-05-04 via the
-- read-only `postgres` MCP. Filter mirrors the Phase 2 listing
-- baseline (rule IR-2):
--
--     WHERE BIZ_KEY = 'VN_VNM0004_000001'
--       AND DOC_TYPE = 'B'
--       AND PROV_STTS NOT IN ('VD', 'EE')
--       AND HAND_REG_YN <> 'Y'
--     ORDER BY ISSU_DT DESC, REG_DTM DESC
--     LIMIT 30
--
-- Date range covered: 2025-09-03 .. 2025-09-08 (7 distinct ISSU_DT).
-- All rows preserve every DEV column verbatim — no value modified, no
-- re-keying, no synthetic data. Per the workspace Data Migration Rule
-- (max 30 rows, real DEV data, idempotent seed).
--
-- Scope and safety
-- ----------------
--   * Idempotent via `ON CONFLICT (BIZ_KEY, DOC_ID) DO NOTHING`.
--     Re-running V52 on a DB that already has these DOC_IDs is a
--     no-op.
--   * Does NOT delete or modify the V51 Sales seed (25 DOC_TYPE='I'
--     rows). The 30 new rows have distinct DOC_IDs that don't collide
--     with any existing local row.
--   * Constraint compliance verified before authoring:
--       PK    (BIZ_KEY, DOC_ID)              — 30 unique DOC_IDs
--       UK01  (BIZ_KEY, REG_DT, SEQ_NO)      — REG_DT NULL on every
--                                              row, PostgreSQL's
--                                              NULLs-distinct semantics
--                                              allow all 30
--       CHK01 DOC_TYPE ∈ ('I','B','E')       — every row 'B'
--       CHK02 PAY_DUE_CD ∈ ('15','30','60','00') — every row '30'
--       CHK07 TRCO_TRSC_CCY_CD ∈ ('VND','USD','999','998') or NULL
--                                              — every row 'VND'
-- ============================================================================

